    "documentation": {
      "html": "<p>Widgets, linked. Make one with <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#CreateWidget\">CreateWidget</a> and read it back with\n<a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#GetWidget\">the read call</a>; a <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Widget\">Widget</a> has a <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Widget$name\">Widget.name</a> and a\n<a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Color\">Color</a>, such as <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Color$RED\">Color.RED</a>. <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Gadget\">Gadget</a> is a resource, <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Links\">Links</a> is this\nservice and String a prelude type. Internal: <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Reveal\">Reveal</a> and <a data-crucible-ref=\"example.links#Secret\">Secret</a>.</p>\n<p><code>[NotALink]</code> in code, and <a href=\"https://example.com\">an ordinary link</a>.</p>\n",
      "markdown": "Widgets, linked. Make one with [CreateWidget] and read it back with\n[the read call][GetWidget]; a [Widget] has a [Widget.name] and a\n[Color], such as [Color.RED]. [Gadget] is a resource, [Links] is this\nservice and [String] a prelude type. Internal: [Reveal] and [Secret].\n\n`[NotALink]` in code, and [an ordinary link](https://example.com).",
      "text": "Widgets, linked. Make one with CreateWidget and read it back with\nthe read call; a Widget has a Widget.name and a\nColor, such as Color.RED. Gadget is a resource, Links is this\nservice and String a prelude type. Internal: Reveal and Secret.\n\n[NotALink] in code, and an ordinary link (https://example.com)."
    },
    "errors": [
      "example.links#WidgetError"
    ],
